#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:84(para)
msgid ""
"The image shows four already defined sample points and the reticle when you "
"press <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> on a measure ruler and then click and drag."
msgstr ""
"Bilden visar fyra redan definierade samplingspunkter och markören när du "
"håller ned <keycap>Ctrl</keycap>, klickar på en måttlinjal och drar."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:109(para)
msgid ""
"Using the <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-color-picker\">Color Picker</link> tool,"
" click-and-drag the sample point up to a measure ruler to delete it."
msgstr ""
"Dra samplingspunkten med verktyget <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-color-"
"picker\">Färgväljare</link> upp till en måttlinjal om du vill ta bort den."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:116(para)
msgid ""
"Using a <link linkend=\"gimp-tool-brush\">paint tool</link>, "
"<keycap>Ctrl</keycap> + click-and-drag the sample point up to a measure "
"ruler to delete it."
msgstr ""
"Dra samplingspunkten upp till en måttlinjal med ett <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"tool-brush\">målarverktyg</link> och <keycap>Ctrl</keycap> nedtryckt om du "
"vill ta bort den."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:105(para)
msgid "To move or delete a sample point: <placeholder-1/>"
msgstr "Så här flyttar eller tar du bort en samplingspunkt: <placeholder-1/>"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:126(para)
msgid ""
"By default, sampling is performed on all layers. If you want to sample on "
"the active layer only, uncheck <menuchoice><guimenu>Sample Point "
"Menu</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sample Merged</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the"
" tab menu."
msgstr ""
"Som standard samplas alla lager. Om du bara vill sampla det aktiva lagret "
"avmarkerar du "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Samplingspunktsmeny</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sampla "
"sammanfogade</guimenuitem></menuchoice> på flikmenyn."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:139(title)
msgid "Sample points dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan Samplingspunkter"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:147(para)
msgid "Information about all sample points is displayed in this window."
msgstr "I det här fönstret visas information om alla samplingspunkter."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:150(para)
msgid "The color of the sampled point is displayed in a swatch box."
msgstr "Färgen på den samplade punkten visas i en färgruta."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:153(para)
msgid "In the drop-down list, you can choose between:"
msgstr "I listrutan kan du välja mellan:"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:160(para)
msgid ""
"This choice displays the <emphasis>Red</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Green</emphasis>, <emphasis>Blue</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>Alpha</emphasis> values of the pixel, as numbers between 0 and "
"255."
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet visar pixelns värden för <emphasis>Röd</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Grön</emphasis>, <emphasis>Blå</emphasis> och "
"<emphasis>Alfa</emphasis> som tal mellan 0 och 255."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:169(term)
msgid "RGB (%)"
msgstr "RGB (%)"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:171(para)
msgid ""
"This choice displays the <emphasis>Red</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Green</emphasis>, <emphasis>Blue</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>Alpha</emphasis> values of the pixel, as percentages. It also "
"shows the hexadecimal value of the pixel's color."
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet visar pixelns värden för <emphasis>Röd</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Grön</emphasis>, <emphasis>Blå</emphasis> och "
"<emphasis>Alfa</emphasis> i procent. Det visar också färgens hexadecimala "
"värde."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:180(term)
msgid "RGB (0..255)"
msgstr "RGB (0..255)"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:182(para)
msgid ""
"This choice displays the <emphasis>Red</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Green</emphasis>, <emphasis>Blue</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>Alpha</emphasis> values of the pixel, as hexadecimal values. It "
"also shows the hexadecimal value of the pixel's color."
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet visar pixelns värden för <emphasis>Röd</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Grön</emphasis>, <emphasis>Blå</emphasis> och "
"<emphasis>Alfa</emphasis> som hexadecimala tal. Det visar också färgens "
"hexadecimala värde."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:201(para)
msgid ""
"This choice displays the <emphasis>Hue</emphasis>, in degrees, as well as "
"the <emphasis>Saturation</emphasis>, <emphasis>Value</emphasis> and "
"<emphasis>Alpha</emphasis> of the pixel, as percentages."
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet visar <emphasis>nyansen</emphasis> i grader samt "
"bildpunktens <emphasis>mättnad</emphasis>, <emphasis>värde</emphasis> och "
"<emphasis>alfa</emphasis> i procent."

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:210(term)
msgid "CIE LCh"
msgstr "CIE LCh"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:218(term)
msgid "CIE LAB"
msgstr "CIE LAB"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:226(term)
msgid "CIE xyY"
msgstr "CIE xyY"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:234(term)
msgid "CIE Yu'v'"
msgstr "CIE Yu'v'"

#: src/dialogs/sample-points.xml:244(para)
msgid ""
"This choice displays the <emphasis>Cyan</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Magenta</emphasis>, <emphasis>Yellow</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Black</emphasis> and <emphasis>Alpha</emphasis> values of the "
"pixel, as percentages."
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet visar pixelns värden för <emphasis>Cyan</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Magenta</emphasis>, <emphasis>Gul</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>Svart</emphasis> och <emphasis>Alfa</emphasis> i procent."
